    feat(dogfood): consume daemon-routed spec_writer tasks - fix DF-SPECLANG-015
    
    AgentCoordinator.watchDaemon subscribes to the daemon's 'task' events and
    invokes the matching agent via the proven `speclang agent` path, with
    in-flight + TTL dedup so 30s reconvergence loops cannot burn tokens.
    The default executor now resolves the repo-local CLI relative to the module
    (the bare 'speclang' binary is not on PATH for daemon/embedded callers),
    bumps the 30s guaranteed-death timeout to 15min (env-overridable), captures
    agent stdout for the caller, stops swallowing failure reasons, and stops
    retrying non-resolution errors. src/cascade/coordinator is a symlink into
    specs/, so this is the live build path (tsc + full suite: 1848 passed rc=0).
    
    Recovered-and-verified from an interrupted sibling wave session; code was
    uncommitted in the main tree.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
